      "post_captions": [
        "Abuses never solve anything. \n\nLet\u2019s guide the misguided. \n\nLet\u2019s work together. \n\nLet\u2019s work for Bharat.",
        "Come, let us make #HarGharTiranga a celebration in every home. \ud83c\uddee\ud83c\uddf3",
        "Let\u2019s make India\u2019s handloom diversity popular. \n\nShare your videos with your favourite handloom products, including GRWM videos. \n\nDon\u2019t forget to use #NationalHandloomDay.",
        "Always #Cheer4Bharat.",
        "Over 13,000 women perform the Dhimsa dance, unique to Andhra Pradesh\u2019s culture. It was a very special gesture.",
        "Thanks to the youngsters who watched my video yesterday and sent insightful suggestions.",
        "HIGH POWERED TASK FORCE on examination reforms under the leadership of Shri Nandan Nilekani constituted. \ud83d\udcdd",
