        "Fast-track courts to be set up to ensure swift and stringent punishment for those involved in paper leaks!",
        "You\u2019ll enjoy knowing more about this scheme cleared by our Cabinet.",
        "Exams have a syllabus, life does not. Life is often completely out of syllabus!",
        "I pray for Sonam Ji\u2019s good health and well-being.\n\n@wangchuksworld \n\n@gitanjalijangmo",
        "History created in squash.\n\n@anahatsingh13",
        "During my Mysuru visit, paid tribute to Swami Vivekananda at the Viveka Smaraka. His ideals inspire us to take pride in our civilisational heritage, serve society with compassion and work tirelessly for the nation.",
        "Met Rajya Sabha MPs this morning at 7, Lok Kalyan Marg.",
        "Some unforgettable moments from today\u2019s visit to Jalandhar. The warmth of the people was truly special!",
        "A historic new frontier for India\u2019s space journey!\n\nAt 11:30 AM today, Skyroot Aerospace will undertake the maiden orbital launch of Vikram-1, India\u2019s first privately developed launch vehicle.\n\nThis four-stage rocket is designed to provide rapid and on-demand launch services. This mission highlights the talent, determination and entrepreneurial spirit of our youth. It also shows how our space-sector reforms are unlocking new opportunities for innovation and enterprise.\n\nMy best wishes to the ent",
        "Exceptional interaction with Team Skyroot! Their passion and energy are unparalleled. \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\ude80\ud83d\ude80\n\n@skyrootaerospace",
        "A great day for Indian badminton!\ud83c\udff8\n\n@pvsindhu1",
        "75 railway stations across India have just got more modern! They will be dedicated to the nation tomorrow. Have a look...",
        "Spoke to the team of Skyroot Aerospace and congratulated them on the successful launch of Vikram-1. \n\nThis is a defining moment in India\u2019s space journey. The growing participation of our private sector is opening new frontiers and accelerating innovation. \n\nThis achievement will encourage countless youngsters to dream bigger and innovate fearlessly.\n\n@skyrootaerospace",
        "Thank you Punjab! It was amazing to be among the people there yesterday.",
        "A lot of youngsters are proudly saying... First in my bloodline to build a rocket, a chip and a drone.",
        "Parliament passes a Bill that makes our examination system more robust!",
        "Tomorrow, the Alluri Sitarama Raju International Airport is going to be inaugurated in Bhogapuram, Andhra Pradesh. \n\nBig boost to infrastructure! \u2708\ufe0f\ud83d\udeeb\ud83d\udeec\u2708\ufe0f",
        "Happy Global Tiger Day! \ud83d\udc05 \n\nHere\u2019s a glimpse of tigers from across India\u2026",
        "More strict actions against paper leaks to come in tomorrow\u2019s Cabinet!"
      ],
